1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,592
This is Contractor AI, a functional product that is live on the web, free and open.

2
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:09,879
It covers forty-nine thousand public contracts from ten countries.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,677
Here is the full user journey.

4
00:00:12,677 --> 00:00:15,799
A citizen or an auditor uploads a contract,

5
00:00:15,799 --> 00:00:19,428
as a PDF or as a link to the official publication,

6
00:00:19,428 --> 00:00:21,025
and picks the country.

7
00:00:21,025 --> 00:00:24,074
This is a fictional example from Paraguay.

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:29,608
The platform reads the document and extracts the title and the amount:

9
00:00:29,608 --> 00:00:31,912
one hundred eighty-eight million,

10
00:00:31,912 --> 00:00:33,518
in Paraguayan currency.

11
00:00:33,518 --> 00:00:36,940
The user checks the details and clicks Calculate.

12
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,307
In seconds,

13
00:00:38,307 --> 00:00:43,798
the price is compared with more than five thousand contracts from the same country,

14
00:00:43,798 --> 00:00:47,172
using the median and the median absolute deviation.

15
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:50,413
This one is normal: six percent above the median.

16
00:00:50,413 --> 00:00:54,647
And every comparable contract is listed, so anyone can check it.

17
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,229
Second, the anomaly feed.

18
00:00:57,229 --> 00:01:01,815
Every contract we ingest is scored by two independent signals:

19
00:01:01,815 --> 00:01:06,992
a BERT and XGBoost model that predicts the price from the description,

20
00:01:06,992 --> 00:01:09,211
and the same statistical test.

21
00:01:09,211 --> 00:01:12,392
Almost four thousand contracts are flagged.

22
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:15,122
Open one to see the evidence.

23
00:01:15,122 --> 00:01:16,059
This contract,

24
00:01:16,059 --> 00:01:17,599
for repairing vehicles,

25
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:21,349
is over two hundred times the price the model predicted.

26
00:01:21,349 --> 00:01:24,966
It is a signal worth investigating, not an accusation.

27
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,642
Third, the territories page.

28
00:01:27,642 --> 00:01:28,273
In Chocó,

29
00:01:28,273 --> 00:01:28,904
Colombia,

30
00:01:28,904 --> 00:01:33,321
more than half of the people lack adequate water or sanitation,

31
00:01:33,321 --> 00:01:36,405
yet none of the contracts there go to water.

32
00:01:36,405 --> 00:01:39,349
Every figure links to its official source.

33
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:44,308
The dashboard sums it all up by country and year.

34
00:01:44,308 --> 00:01:49,700
Contractor AI is live today, in Spanish, Portuguese and English.
